### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Get All Products (Default Pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products HTTP/1.1

### 2. Search & Filter Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=Keyboard&category=Electronics&minPrice=50&maxPrice=200 HTTP/1.1

### 3. Get Inventory Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/statistics HTTP/1.1

### 4. Create New Product
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/products HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ultra-Wide Gaming Monitor 34\"",
  "description": "144Hz curved gaming display with HDR400 and USB-C hub.",
  "price": 499.99,
  "stockQuantity": 15,
  "category": "Electronics",
  "sku": "ELEC-MON-007",
  "isActive": true
}

### 5. Get Product By ID (Replace with actual ID from create response)
@productId = {{createProduct.response.body.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}} HTTP/1.1

### 6. Update Product (Partial Update)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 459.99,
  "stockQuantity": 20
}

### 7. Delete Product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}} HTTP/1.1
